00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:22.230
So I thought on my own and figured out how...

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:25.730
and when I was able to draw it well, it made me feel good.

00:15:26.270 --> 00:15:28.690
You thought by yourself?

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:32.280
But, I can't draw.

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:35.950
It's not necessarily limited to drawing.

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:44.460
I wonder if it was because Momo and the others
cared for me that I didn't end up hating drawing.

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:46.960
That's how I think about it now.

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:47.920
Is that so?

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:49.300
Yeah.

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:51.470
Somehow, it feels like that.

00:15:57.100 --> 00:15:59.430
Mea's expression...

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:09.440
Mea!

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:10.990
In those clothes...

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:24.880
Senpai.

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:26.790
So you were still here?

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:29.590
What are you doing there?

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:32.800
Even though it's after school, you'll stand out in those clothes.

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:33.880
Why?

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:36.300
This is my real appearance.

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:38.640
Not Kurosaki Mea.

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:41.430
My appearance as the Transformation Weapon Mea.

00:16:41.430 --> 00:16:43.310
That's what Master told me.

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:48.650
Mea, you say that like your Master is always right,

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:53.400
but do you really think everything your Master says is right?

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:57.910
Are you saying Master is wrong?

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:04.000
That is inexcusable, Senpai.

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:10.300
My body is moving on its own!

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:13.130
This is the ultimate ability of Psycho Dive.

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:15.800
I've taken control of your body, Senpai.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:18.550
For you to deny that Master is right,

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:20.260
that means you need to be punished, huh?

00:17:22.970 --> 00:17:24.100
I know...

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:28.310
...what to do to make you embarrassed.

00:17:42.990 --> 00:17:49.420
You look like a dog panting like that, Senpai.

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:57.180
Your body is a part of mine now, Senpai.

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:01.760
What's more, I'm not just controlling you...

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:04.930
...our sensations are synced as well.

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:13.650
You can tell how my body is reacting to you, right, Senpai?

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:17.070
I can tell too.

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:23.330
Impatience, confusion and also... your perverted mood.

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:30.630
What is it?

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:37.720
Certainly, your emotions are flowing to me...

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:40.720
Uneasiness and loneliness...

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:44.260
The feeling of not knowing where to go, as if you're within pitch blackness...

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:48.140
Like a lost child, all alone. {bocchi-chan!}

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:55.650
But Mea, you're not alone!

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:57.610
You have the friends you've made here on Earth.

00:18:57.610 --> 00:19:03.410
T-That's just because I'm acting like an Earthling on Master's orders!

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:06.200
In order to observe Yami-oneechan's everyday life!

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:12.710
Were you following your Master's orders{omit "that time?"} when you tried to save Nana from that truck?

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:16.670
When she became friends with you,

00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:19.380
Nana was glad from the bottom of her heart.

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:27.100
Found you, Redheaded Mea.

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:30.690
Don't you dare interfere.

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:32.730
I'm going to take care of her.

00:19:32.730 --> 00:19:35.360
No, she's my prey.

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:37.110
I must pay her back.

00:19:37.110 --> 00:19:39.570
I cannot withdraw.

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:43.740
I've waited two years for my chance to
vindicate my loss of honour against her.

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:46.450
Then why don't we ask her?

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:47.870
That's a good idea.

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:49.700
We can let her decide who she wants to be killed by.

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:52.710
Who are you?

00:19:54.630 --> 00:19:56.000
Don't mess with me!

00:19:56.000 --> 00:20:00.590
Are you saying you forgot about destroying my spaceship?!

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:03.220
And how you beat me senseless?!

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:04.220
I will kill you!

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:09.180
Who the heck are those guys?!

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:15.400
I did lots of things to make money and
collect information on Yami-oneechan.

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:19.360
But... How did you find out where I was?

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:21.740
The information was spread about.

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:23.700
By someone named "Nemesis".

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:27.950
I don't know who it is, but it looks like I was right to believe it!

00:20:27.950 --> 00:20:31.870
That's probably someone else who wants to kill you!

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:38.250
Mea!

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:40.960
How could you do something like that to a girl-

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:49.060
I'll crush you!

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:55.560
Why you-!

00:20:56.810 --> 00:20:59.440
It's been a while since I've felt like this!

00:20:59.730 --> 00:21:02.240
I understand now, Master.

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:04.030
The reason why you called them.

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:08.280
So that I would remember, right?

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:14.290
That I'm a weapon.

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:24.470
I bought cake for Mea, too.

00:21:25.340 --> 00:21:28.890
She'll be surprised if I show up suddenly to give it to her, won't she?

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:34.810
Damn it!

00:21:34.810 --> 00:21:35.850
What are you, a monster?!

00:21:35.850 --> 00:21:38.150
What is this...?

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:39.860
Are you going to run away?

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:44.860
I'm even holding back for you, so let's play a little more, gentlemen.

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:47.320
Mea...

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:13.390
<b>niwasaki yureru hana ga tsun to senobi de kotaeru</b>

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:13.390
<b>庭先揺れる花がツンと背伸びで応える</b>

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:13.390
<b>The flower swaying in the garden answers by stretching up</b>

00:22:13.140 --> 00:22:19.020
<b>tsumasakidachi de asa ni ohayou no kisu</b>

00:22:13.140 --> 00:22:19.020
<b>つま先立ちで朝におはようのKiss</b>

00:22:13.140 --> 00:22:19.020
<b>To give a good morning kiss standing on tiptoes</b>

00:22:19.270 --> 00:22:21.940
<b>saa yukou</b>

00:22:19.270 --> 00:22:21.940
<b>さあ行こう</b>

00:22:19.270 --> 00:22:21.940
<b>Now let's go!</b>

00:22:21.690 --> 00:22:28.740
<b>fui ni tsumujikaze omowazu shagamikomu</b>

00:22:21.690 --> 00:22:28.740
<b>不意につむじ風思わずしゃがみ込む</b>

00:22:21.690 --> 00:22:28.740
<b>Caught off guard by the sudden whirlwind, I reflexively crouch down</b>

00:22:28.490 --> 00:22:41.040
<b>fuwari sukaato ni kakushita yowasatsuyoku haratte miseta</b>

00:22:28.490 --> 00:22:41.040
<b>ふわりスカートに隠した弱さ 強く払ってみせた</b>

00:22:28.490 --> 00:22:41.040
<b>I firmly brush off the weakness hidden inside my skirt</b>

00:22:41.920 --> 00:22:50.090
<b>fuzoroi de sainan na nichijou ni sakihokorou</b>

00:22:41.920 --> 00:22:50.090
<b>不揃いで災難な日常に咲き誇ろう</b>

00:22:41.920 --> 00:22:50.090
<b>Let's bloom to our fullest in this strange everyday life full of misfortune</b>

00:22:50.260 --> 00:22:58.270
<b>sunao ni sodatanai kara chanto mitenakucha</b>

00:22:50.260 --> 00:22:58.270
<b>素直に育たないからちゃんと見てなくちゃ</b>

00:22:50.260 --> 00:22:58.270
<b>I can't be honest, so you have to pay close attention</b>

00:22:58.020 --> 00:23:06.280
<b>tameratta ano omoi sotto tsuchi ni umetanda</b>

00:22:58.020 --> 00:23:06.280
<b>躊躇ったあの想いそっと土に埋めたんだ</b>

00:22:58.020 --> 00:23:06.280
<b>I carefully buried the memory of my hesitance in the soil</b>

00:23:06.030 --> 00:23:12.530
<b>A flower blooming in your heart</b>

00:23:12.280 --> 00:23:17.830
<b>sono hi o yume mite</b>

00:23:12.280 --> 00:23:17.830
<b>その日を夢見て</b>

00:23:12.280 --> 00:23:17.830
<b>I dream of that day</b>

